(Bernadette:)Oh, hey, Raj, what
are you doing here?

10
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,350
(Raj:)I just felt like drinking alone,

11
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,950
(Raj:)because I'm deep and dark.

12
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,650
(Bernadette:)Uh-huh.

13
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,150
